, such as by using reinforcement learning or meta-learning.\nLong-Term Research Directions:"), mdx("p", null, "Developing More Accurate and Efficient NL-to-SQL Models: Long-term research directions could focus on developing more accurate and efficient NL-to-SQL models that can handle complex queries and large-scale data.\nImproving the Interpretability of NL-to-SQL Models: Long-term research directions could focus on improving the interpretability of NL-to-SQL models, such as by developing more transparent and explainable models.\nDeveloping More Effective Evaluation Metrics: Long-term research directions could focus on developing more effective evaluation metrics for NL-to-SQL tasks, such as metrics that capture the accuracy, efficiency, and interpretability of models."), mdx("h3", {
